      "method": "baseline_cmp3_baseline_v2",
      "paper_id": "1AYy3T3Xjk",
      "weakness": "Terminology inconsistency: model called 'instruction-tuned evaluator' but is fine-tuned for a specific output format rather than instruction-tuned in the standard sense (e.g. RLHF on varied instructions).",
