      "error_type": "Invalid Criticism",
      "justification": "This is a pedantic terminology quibble not tied to any actual flaw in the paper's methodology or results; the paper's usage (LoRA fine-tuning to follow an instruction format) is a defensible use of the term, making this an overly harsh nitpick similar to the typo-inspection examples in the guideline.",
      "status": "ok"
    },
