      "method": "baseline_cmp3_baseline_v2",
      "paper_id": "1AYy3T3Xjk",
      "weakness": "ITA visualization (Figure 3) is dense and difficult to interpret from the text description alone; clearer explanation of node/edge semantics would help.",
      "reliable": 1,
