      "method": "baseline_cmp3_baseline_v2",
      "paper_id": "1E4Bltg6Xb",
      "weakness": "Baseline comparison against 'All Dynamics' (AD) is unfair/incomplete, missing comparisons such as simple local k-hop features without policy attention and GNN-based encoders that aggregate neighborhood information.",
