      "error_type": "Neglect",
      "justification": "The ablation study (Section 5.3, Figure 6) already tests k=-1.0 (no policy attention) with varying n, i.e., local n-hop features without policy attention, and GCN+DQN+AD is already a GNN-based encoder baseline over the full graph, so these specific missing-baseline claims overlook existing experiments.",
